        "line": 29,
        "text": "def profile (a z : ℝ) : ℝ := (Real.Gamma a)⁻¹ * moment a 0 z, i.e. (Γ a)⁻¹ ∫_{v>0} e^{-v} v^{a-1} (1+zv)^{1-a} dv; at a = 1+h this is the manuscript's H of (4.29)"
